Package: adbd
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, python3, ffmpeg, xvfb, xfce4-session, dbus,
 dbus-x11, x11-utils, libx11-6, libxtst6, iproute2, procps, systemd, util-linux
Recommends: dnsmasq, nftables, samba
Description: AOSP device-side Android Debug Bridge daemon for Linux
 Standalone Linux port of the AOSP master adbd, supporting FunctionFS USB,
 explicitly configured TCP/VSOCK, shell, file sync, and port forwarding.
 Android framework authentication and TLS pairing are not included.
 Includes the generic FunctionFS gadget manager and its systemd unit.
